menu "p3a test hooks"

    config P3A_TEST_HOOKS
        bool "Build the test hooks"
        default n
        help
            Adds the hooks that automated device tests drive: a command
            console on the UART, and later HTTP endpoints for screenshots,
            touch injection and fault injection. See docs/2.0/TESTING.md.

            Never enable this in a release build. It is set only by
            sdkconfig.test.defaults, and tools/check_tree.py fails a release
            build that contains it.

endmenu
